{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#2280","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#2280","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#2280\",\"parent_revision\":\"33c1fa6ac9c8a5f4ae37c56615b928b8f078e550b0df41ea49e814bb5a28e1d2\",\"root_revision\":\"33c1fa6ac9c8a5f4ae37c56615b928b8f078e550b0df41ea49e814bb5a28e1d2\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: closed\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nThe start-task skill's documented invocation format is `{task_file_path} --task {task_id}`, which requires the caller to supply a filesystem path to the plan YAML file. This path is an internal implementation detail of the SAM backend \u2014 it should never be visible at the skill interface level.\\n\\nThe SAM MCP server already resolves plan addresses: `sam_plan(action=status, plan=\\\"Pdec8934d\\\")` and `sam_plan(action=read, plan=\\\"Pdec8934d\\\")` both work with the address alone. The file path is available internally via the `source_path` field in the read response.\\n\\nThe correct interface is `{plan_address} --task {task_id}` (e.g. `Pdec8934d --task T01`), with start-task resolving the plan internally via MCP rather than accepting a caller-supplied path.\\n\\nSecondary unknown: whether start-task currently passes the path argument to the SAM MCP (making this a doc+interface bug) or reads the YAML file directly (making it a code bug as well). This needs to be verified by reading the start-task skill implementation.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **developer relying on this plugin**, I want to **start-task skill requires filesystem path \u2014 plan address should be sufficient** so that **the tool works correctly and reliably**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Observed during /dh:implement-feature Pdec8934d \u2014 orchestrator had to call sam_plan(action=read) and extract source_path to obtain the file path required by start-task args\\n- **Priority**: P1\\n- **Added**: 2026-05-15\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"daa417bcc560ff658078296db0a2ae9e841a5be653117144daf2c3a2aecf6dfa\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABVCTuNQ\"}"}